* {{homophones|cellar|lang=en}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|seller}}, {{m|enm|sellere}}, (also {{m|enm|siller}}, {{m|enm|sullar}}, {{m|enm|sullere}}), from {{inh|en|ang|*sellere}}, {{m|ang|*syllere}}, equivalent to {{affix|en|sell|-er}}. Cognate with {{cog|da|sælger}}, {{cog|sv|säljare}}, {{cog|is|seljari||a seller; dealer}}.

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# Someone who [[sell]]s; a [[vendor]]; a [[clerk]].
#: ''Alisha was a '''seller''' of fine books.''
# Something which sells.
#: ''Two of the books Alisha authored had become banner '''sellers'''.''

